WEBVTT

00:07:29.746 --> 00:07:32.079
And I wish I could figure out why

00:07:32.454 --> 00:07:37.329
I would describe this moment in my career
as a transition point and full of promise.

00:07:37.746 --> 00:07:39.913
And I wish I could get started now.

00:07:40.746 --> 00:07:44.788
Yeah, I get that. And those of you who are
feeling flat out miserable right now,

00:07:44.788 --> 00:07:48.121
no sense of optimism. It's OK.
You have company, too.

00:07:48.829 --> 00:07:55.038
I would describe this moment in my career
as a body blow and total blindside,

00:07:56.079 --> 00:07:57.496
and I wish I could respond.

00:07:58.288 --> 00:08:00.246
I would describe this moment in my